<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/roblox.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/dev.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/develop.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="roblox-topbar">
    <div class="roblox-brand">
      <span class="roblox-brand-mark">R</span>
      <span>LuckyBlox Studio</span>
    </div>
    <nav class="roblox-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <div class="roblox-nav-links">
        <a href="/dev">Home</a>
        <a href="/dev/game/1818/settings">Game</a>
        <a href="/dev/assets">Assets</a>
        <a href="/dev/docs" class="active">API</a>
        <div class="roblox-more-pages">
          <button class="roblox-more-pages-btn" type="button">More pages &#9662;</button>
          <div class="roblox-more-pages-dropdown">
            <a href="/dev/create">Create Game</a>
            <a href="/dev/docs/games">Game Engine API</a>
            <a href="/dev/docs/places">Place API</a>
            <a href="/dev/docs/users">User API</a>
            <a href="/dev/docs/auth">Auth API</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="roblox-right">
      <span class="ch-robux"><img class="ch-ico" src="/icons/robux.svg" alt="Robux" /> <%= (currency && currency.robux) || user.robux || 0 %></span>
      <span class="roblox-icon-button" title="Account settings"><img class="ch-ico" src="/icons/settings.svg" alt="" /></span>
      <span class="roblox-icon-button" title="Notifications"><img class="ch-ico" src="/icons/notifications.svg" alt="" /></span>
      <span class="roblox-icon-button" title="Profile"><img class="ch-ico" src="/icons/profile.svg" alt="" /></span>
      <a class="dev-btn secondary" href="/logout" style="height:32px;padding:0 10px;font-size:12px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;line-height:1;">Sign Out</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="dev-shell">
    <aside class="dev-sidebar">
      <div class="dev-sidebar-brand">Studio</div>
      <a href="/dev"><span class="dev-sidebar-icon">&#8962;</span> Home</a>
      <a href="/dev/create"><span class="dev-sidebar-icon"><img class="ch-ico" src="/icons/plus.svg" alt="" /></span> Create</a>
      <a href="/dev/game/1818/settings"><span class="dev-sidebar-icon"><img class="ch-ico" src="/icons/settings.svg" alt="" /></span> Settings</a>
      <a href="/dev/assets"><span class="dev-sidebar-icon"><img class="ch-ico" src="/icons/assets.svg" alt="" /></span> Assets</a>
      <a href="/dev/docs"><span class="dev-sidebar-icon">&#8505;</span> API Docs</a>
      <a href="/dev/docs/auth" class="active"><span class="dev-sidebar-icon">&#9654;</span> Auth API</a>
    </aside>

    <main class="dev-main">
      <div class="dev-header">
        <div>
          <h1>Authentication API</h1>
          <div class="dev-header-subtitle">Sign in, sign up, and session management</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-api-section">
        <h3><span class="dev-method post">POST</span><span class="dev-endpoint">/api/v1/auth/login</span></h3>
        <p>Authenticate with username and password.</p>
        <div class="dev-code-block">// POST /api/v1/auth/login
// Body: { username: "player", password: "..." }
{
  "ok": true,
  "userId": "1",
  "ticket": {
    "ticket": "abc123",
    "authTicket": "xyz789",
    "expiresAt": "2026-09-13T12:00:00Z"
  }
}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-api-section">
        <h3><span class="dev-method post">POST</span><span class="dev-endpoint">/api/v1/auth/register</span></h3>
        <p>Create a new account.</p>
        <div class="dev-code-block">// POST /api/v1/auth/register
// Body: { username: "newplayer", password: "..." }
{
  "ok": true,
  "userId": "2",
  "ticket": { ... }
}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-api-section">
        <h3><span class="dev-method post">POST</span><span class="dev-endpoint">/api/v1/auth/session</span></h3>
        <p>Validate session token.</p>
        <div class="dev-code-block">// POST /api/v1/auth/session
// Cookie: luckblox_session=abc
{ "ok": true, "userId": "1", "valid": true }</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-api-section">
        <h3><span class="dev-method post">POST</span><span class="dev-endpoint">/api/v1/auth/logout</span></h3>
        <p>End current session.</p>
        <div class="dev-code-block">// POST /api/v1/auth/logout
{ "ok": true }</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-api-section">
        <h3><span class="dev-method post">POST</span><span class="dev-endpoint">/api/v1/auth/refresh</span></h3>
        <p>Refresh auth ticket before expiry.</p>
        <div class="dev-code-block">// POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
// Body: { ticket: "abc123" }
{ "ok": true, "ticket": { ... } }</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-api-section">
        <h3><span class="dev-method post">POST</span><span class="dev-endpoint">/api/v1/auth/asset-platform/login</span></h3>
        <p>Login via Asset Platform (CAP). Returns CORS-enabled auth ticket.</p>
        <div class="dev-code-block">// POST /api/v1/auth/asset-platform/login
// Content-Type: application/json
{
  "ok": true,
  "ticket": { ... }
}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-api-section">
        <h3>Session Cookie</h3>
        <p>After login, the server sets a <code>luckblox_session</code> HTTP-only cookie. Include it on subsequent requests for automatic authentication.</p>
        <div class="dev-code-block">Set-Cookie: luckblox_session=lb_xxx; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax; Path=/</div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-api-section">
        <h3>X-User-ID Header</h3>
        <p>For API testing without cookies, include the <code>X-User-ID</code> header to specify the user context.</p>
        <div class="dev-code-block">X-User-ID: 1</div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
<%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
